{'symbol': 'CMS', 'date': '2022-10-18 08:00:00', 'title': 'CONSUMERS ENERGY FOUNDATION ANNOUNCES $500,000 AWARDED TO CRISTO REY COMMUNITY CENTER, ROSCOMMON COUNTY UNITED WAY', 'text': 'JACKSON, MICH. , OCT. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE CONSUMERS ENERGY FOUNDATION ANNOUNCED TWO GRANTS TODAY TOTALING $500,000 FOR TWO ORGANIZATIONS — CRISTO REY COMMUNITY CENTER IN LANSING AND ROSCOMMON COUNTY UNITED WAY — IN ITS THIRD YEAR OF PEOPLE AWARDS DISBURSEMENTS.'}